item('RETRO-04',['00213'],'Exactly 1.5 × ULN bilirubin was assigned unilaterally to the lower printed band.','Added boundary review: printed ≤1.5 and 1.5–3 overlap. Starting-dose table restricted to initial treatment; existing later-treatment review retained.',{'00213':'p2 table2'},'moderate')
